    "scenesThatPass": [
      "FELICIA LB: You are! Where am I going?\nFELICIA: Here, stand there. Not this one.",
      "FELICIA: No, you really do -- LB I tried to become Hercules.\nLB FELICIA: I'm gonna steal mommy's shoes! Now I've got your shoes!",
      "NINA: Here, we have, here, let me check.\nJAMIE: We've got three shades of the exact same red that everyone else is convinced is NINA different. It's not the exact same red!\nJAMIE NINA: This one, apparently, is blue. Here, I'm going to try... I'm going to do stripes.",
      "FELICIA LB: What? That was quite a stunt that you pulled.\nFELICIA: What do you mean?",
      "FELICIA: Well, I just forgot how much I love being at work! We're almost finished.\nCYNTHIA: Oh, the reservation can wait, this is such a hoot, really."
    ]
  },
