        "line": 1,
        "text": "It was always better on the piano, I don't know why. So to answer your question, yes, I carry her around with me quite a bit. I've often seen her in the garden working. Julia Vega swears that she's at the top of the stairs every morning when she comes down to do the laundry."
      },
      "last": {
        "speaker": 0,
        "line": 794,
        "text": "Any questions?"
      }
